  "title": "25 September 1967: Recording, mixing: The Fool On The Hill",
  "date": "1967-09-25",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>Studio Two, EMI Studios, Abbey Road<br>\nProducer: <a href=\"/people/george-martin/\">George Martin</a><br>\nEngineer: Ken Scott</p><p><a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a> had taped a demo of <a href=\"/songs/the-fool-on-the-hill/\">‘The Fool On The Hill’</a> on <a href=\"/1967/09/06/recording-mixing-i-am-the-walrus-the-fool-on-the-hill-blue-jay-way/\">6 September 1967</a>. During this evening’s recording session The Beatles began proper work on the song. <span id=\"more-6419\"></span></p><div class=\"epyt-video-wrapper\"><iframe id=\"_ytid_22449\" width=\"580\" height=\"435\" data-origwidth=\"580\" data-origheight=\"435\" data-relstop=\"1\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tQ-Fq_pfMYw?enablejsapi=1&amp;autoplay=0&amp;cc_load_policy=0&amp;cc_lang_pref=&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;loop=0&amp;rel=0&amp;fs=1&amp;playsinline=0&amp;autohide=2&amp;theme=dark&amp;color=red&amp;controls=1&amp;disablekb=0&amp;\" class=\"__youtube_prefs__  epyt-is-override  no-lazyload\" title=\"YouTube player\" allow=\"fullscreen; accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-no-lazy=\"1\" data-skipgform_ajax_framebjll=\"\"></iframe></div><p>Three takes of the backing track were recorded, followed by overdubs. By the close of the session ‘The Fool On The Hill’ featured two pianos, drums, acoustic guitar, recorders and lead vocals.</p><p>A reduction mix, numbered take four, was also made. A mono mix was made towards the end of the session, which drew to a close at 3am. The work in progress can be heard on 1996’s <a href=\"/albums/anthology-2/\"><em>Anthology 2</em></a>.</p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1967/09/25/recording-mixing-the-fool-on-the-hill/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-6419 gallery-columns-2 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670925-beatles_01/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTU1IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE1NSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"155\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_01-200x155.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles with Japanese reporter Rumiko Hoshika, 25 September 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_01-200x155.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_01-580x450.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_01-960x744.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_01-768x596.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_01.jpg 1207w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"24302\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670925-beatles_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1207,936\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles with Japanese reporter Rumiko Hoshika, 25 September 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_01-960x744.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670925-beatles_02/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTM2IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDEzNiI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"136\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_02-200x136.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"George Harrison with Japanese reporter Rumiko Hoshika, 25 September 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_02-200x136.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_02-580x396.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_02-960x655.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_02-768x524.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_02.jpg 973w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"24303\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670925-beatles_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"973,664\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"George Harrison with Japanese reporter Rumiko Hoshika, 25 September 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_02-960x655.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670925-beatles_03/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTQ1IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE0NSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"145\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_03-200x145.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Ringo Starr with Japanese reporter Rumiko Hoshika, 25 September 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_03-200x145.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_03-580x419.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_03-768x555.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_03.jpg 937w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"24304\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670925-beatles_03/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_03.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"937,677\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Ringo Starr with Japanese reporter Rumiko Hoshika, 25 September 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_03.jpg\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670925-beatles_04/\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSIyMDAiIGhlaWdodD0iMTUxIiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgMjAwIDE1MSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"151\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_04-200x151.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"John Lennon with Japanese reporter Rumiko Hoshika, 25 September 1967\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_04-200x151.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_04-580x438.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_04-768x580.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_04.jpg 926w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"24305\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670925-beatles_04/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_04.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"926,699\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John Lennon with Japanese reporter Rumiko Hoshika, 25 September 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-beatles_04.jpg\"></a></div></figure></div><p>Also present at the session were two Japanese journalists: reporter Rumiko Hoshika and photographer Koh Hasebe from the magazine <em>Music Life</em>. A number of photographs of The Beatles at work were subsequently published, and rehearsals of the song and interviews were also recorded.</p><p>This is believed to be the first Beatles recording session attended by <a href=\"/people/yoko-ono/\">Yoko Ono</a>. She was photographed on the day talking to her future husband <a href=\"/people/john-lennon/\">John Lennon</a>.</p><p><a href=\"/gallery/1967-photos/670925-john-lennon-yoko-ono_01/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-48261\"><img data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI3ODIiIGhlaWdodD0iNzQ1IiB2aWV3Qm94PSIwIDAgNzgyIDc0NSI+PHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjEwMCUiIGhlaWdodD0iMTAwJSIgZmlsbD0iI2NmZDRkYiIvPjwvc3ZnPg==\" decoding=\"async\" data-attachment-id=\"48261\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1967-photos/670925-john-lennon-yoko-ono_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-john-lennon-yoko-ono_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"782,745\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"John Lennon and Yoko Ono, EMI Studios, 25 September 1967\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-john-lennon-yoko-ono_01.jpg\" data-src=\"/wp/media/670925-john-lennon-yoko-ono_01.jpg\" alt=\"John Lennon and Yoko Ono, EMI Studios, 25 September 1967\" width=\"782\" height=\"745\" class=\"aligncenter size-full wp-image-48261\" data-srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-john-lennon-yoko-ono_01.jpg 782w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-john-lennon-yoko-ono_01-580x553.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-john-lennon-yoko-ono_01-200x191.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/670925-john-lennon-yoko-ono_01-768x732.jpg 768w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 782px) 100vw, 782px\"></a></p><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Page last updated:</strong> 24 November 2025</div></div></div><div class=\"on-this-day-wrapper\"><h3>Also on this day...</h3><ul><li>2026: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2026/09/25/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-bethel-woods-center-arts-bethel-4/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Bethel Woods Center for the Arts, Bethel</a></li><li>2018: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2018/09/25/ringo-starr-all-starr-band-live-paramount-theatre-denver-2/\">Ringo Starr and his All-Starr Band live: Paramount Theatre, Denver</a></li><li>2009: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2009/09/25/olivia-harrison-wins-friar-park-fence-battle/\">Olivia Harrison wins Friar Park fence battle</a></li><li>2008: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2008/09/25/paul-mccartney-live-yarkon-park-tel-aviv/\">Paul McCartney live: Yarkon Park, Tel Aviv</a></li><li>2006: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2006/09/25/uk-album-release-ecce-cor-meum-paul-mccartney/\">UK album release: Ecce Cor Meum by Paul McCartney</a></li><li>1997: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1997/09/25/us-album-release-standing-stone-paul-mccartney/\">US album release: Standing Stone by Paul McCartney</a></li><li>1993: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1993/09/25/paul-mccartney-live-scandinavium-gothenburg-2/\">Paul McCartney live: Scandinavium, Gothenburg</a></li><li>1980: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1980/09/25/mixing-just-like-starting-over-john-lennon-yoko-ono/\">Mixing: (Just Like) Starting Over by John Lennon and Yoko Ono</a></li><li>1980: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1980/09/25/recording-woman-every-man-has-a-woman-who-loves-him-john-l